# case-management-flow

## Case Status Workflow
- Progressive status tracking from intake through resolution
- Milestone sequencing based on case type:
  - Custody reunification path
  - Record expungement path
- Auto-advancement logic based on document verification
- Required document checklist generation by case type
Importance Score: 85

## Document Verification States
- Staged verification process for legal documents
- Document requirements matrix by case type
- Auto-validation of document completeness
- Version control for legal document revisions
Importance Score: 80

## Case Milestone Tracking
- Sequential milestone completion enforcement
- Dependency mapping between milestones
- Deadline calculation and tracking
- Required action prompts based on milestone state
Importance Score: 75

## Legal Process Automation
- Template generation based on case parameters
- Required fields validation per document type
- Auto-population of standard legal forms
- Case-specific checklist management
Importance Score: 90

